{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"closer\": \"X\",\n  \"x_off\": [\n    \"S10侧重怀念带来的暖意与酸楚，对怀念如何直接牵动维护尊严的行动，呈现得稍弱。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_off\": [\n    \"S04删去了害怕回去后又要忍让的顾虑，削弱了维护尊严与怀念旧日亲近之间的正面冲突。\",\n    \"S10把怀念转向了回去后能否恢复从前的生活，增加了对旧日关系能否复原的现实疑虑，使主线部分偏向回归可能性，而非尊严与归属怀念的持续拉扯。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"X在S04明确保留了对重新忍让的抗拒，使怀念与维护尊严两股力量同时存在；Y则将这一冲突弱化为对过去能否重现的疑问。两条线整体结构高度相同，但X更完整地扣住了Center的核心矛盾。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7a41b184-7ce7-4fa5-9d83-51d2cf47fa31", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T103129667051Z", "elapsed_seconds": 14.64, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T10:31:44.313887+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "07d7ebfeaf7817533afc20f3ce8050e92a44ee926a7b433d2f6d4a54b564957d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c1